# Disposable toy-repo clones created by test/helpers/toyRepo.ts.
# Deliberately NOT under os.tmpdir(): the sandbox write allowlist covers $TMPDIR,
# so a git worktree created under a temp path would be silently unfenced
# (spec §4.2, plan Section E item 7).
.factory-test-repos/

